<% page_title 'Know Scripture by heart · Memverse' %>
<div class="lp heritage palette">
  <section class="landing-hero">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <span class="hero-kicker"><i></i>A free tool for Scripture memorization</span>
      <h1>Treasure God’s word.<br><em>Know it by heart.</em></h1>
      <p>God’s word is to be treasured, remembered, and obeyed. Memverse helps you memorize Scripture and retain it through regular review.</p>
      <blockquote class="biblical-foundation"><p>“Thy word have I hid in mine heart, that I might not sin against thee.”</p><cite><a href="https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Psalm+119%3A11&amp;version=KJV">Psalm 119:11 · KJV</a></cite></blockquote>
      <div class="hero-actions"><a class="cta" href="#scripture-practice" data-demo-start>Begin memorizing <span>→</span></a><%= link_to 'Create your free account ↗', new_user_registration_path %></div>
      <span class="hero-note">Practice Psalm 23:1 below. No account required.</span>
    </div>
    <div class="sample-visual" aria-label="An illustration of learning and returning to Scripture">
      <div class="floating-label">Learn Scripture by heart.</div>
      <div class="verse-window"><div class="window-top"><span class="mini-mark">mv</span><span>Scripture to memorize</span><span class="window-dots" aria-hidden="true">•••</span></div><div class="verse-window-content"><span class="kicker">Psalm 23:1 · KJV</span><p>The LORD is my shepherd;<br>I shall not want.</p><div class="verse-underline"></div></div><div class="sample-status"><span><i></i>Learning</span><span>Read carefully. Recall accurately.</span></div></div>
      <div class="return-card"><span class="return-symbol" aria-hidden="true">↻</span><div><b>Review what you have learned.</b><small>Review intervals adapt to your recall.</small></div><span class="little-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="belief-strip"><span>One verse or a thousand</span><h2>A growing collection.<br>A manageable daily practice.</h2><p>You don’t review everything every day.<br>Your recall guides what comes next.</p></section>
  <section id="how-it-works" class="how-section"><div class="section-intro"><span class="kicker">Learn accurately. Review consistently.</span><h2>Memorize Scripture.<br>Retain what you learn.</h2><p>Begin with a few verses or review a collection of thousands.<br>Your recall determines when each verse is reviewed.</p></div>
    <div class="how-grid"><article><span class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">⌕</span><h3>Choose a passage.</h3><p>Search by reference or words. Choose individual verses or passages, in the translation you use.</p><span>01 / Choose</span></article><article><span class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">Aa</span><h3>Learn it by heart.</h3><p>Read the text carefully. Recall it from memory, compare your answer, and practice until you know the words.</p><span>02 / Learn</span></article><article><span class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">↻</span><h3>Retain what you learn.</h3><p>Rate your recall. Memverse uses spaced repetition to schedule reviews and help you retain Scripture over time.</p><span>03 / Remember</span></article></div>
  </section>
  <section id="scripture-practice" class="landing-demo" aria-label="Memorize Psalm 23:1"><div><span class="kicker">Scripture memorization</span><h2>Commit this verse<br>to memory.</h2><p>Read the verse carefully. Then recall the missing word.</p></div><div class="demo-card"><span class="kicker">Psalm 23:1 · KJV</span><div data-demo-reading><p>The LORD is my shepherd;<br>I shall not want.</p><button type="button" class="text-cta" data-demo-start>Recall the missing word →</button></div><div data-demo-exercise hidden><p>The LORD is my <input id="heritage-demo-answer" aria-label="Missing word in Psalm 23:1" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" placeholder="…">;<br>I shall not want.</p><div class="demo-controls"><button type="button" data-demo-reveal>Reveal the word</button><span role="status" data-demo-status>Recall the missing word. Reveal it if needed.</span></div><%= link_to 'Keep learning with a free account ↗', new_user_registration_path, class: 'text-cta', data: {demo_continue: true}, hidden: true %></div><noscript><%= link_to 'Try a review →', demo_path %></noscript></div></section>
  <section id="community" class="landing-community"><div><span class="kicker">The word of Christ among us</span><h2>Encourage one another in Scripture.</h2><p>Study, ask questions, and encourage others to persevere in learning God’s word.</p></div><div class="community-links"><%= link_to thredded.root_path do %><span>01 / Forum</span><b>Discuss Scripture and memorization.</b><small>Join the conversation ↗</small><% end %><%= link_to live_quiz_path do %><span>02 / Live quiz</span><b>Test your knowledge of Scripture.</b><small>Explore the live quiz ↗</small><% end %><%= link_to bloggity.root_path do %><span>03 / Blog</span><b>Read about Scripture memorization.</b><small>Read the latest ↗</small><% end %></div></section>
  <section class="final-invitation"><span class="heritage-brand">memverse</span><h2>Know Scripture by heart.<br>Attend to it throughout your life.</h2><%= link_to 'Begin memorizing Scripture ↗', new_user_registration_path, class: 'cta' %></section>
</div>
